Subject: [PATCH] [v2 only] bench: orchestrate real-block fixture and WS/WSS
 load matrix

Generate one validated 40-large-block fixture and clone it for 50/100/250/500-peer relay and 50-block serving cells. Preserve exact corpus identities, per-thread process samples and successful-cell resumability. The corpus uses actual UTXO spends and explicitly documented high-entropy OP_RETURN padding; it is not a mainnet compression model. Baseline matrix results remain separate measured evidence, with no speedup claim.
